OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the Proms,
OL,8,     Fincluding music by Mahler, and
OL,9,     Fpianist Bertrand Chamayou performs
OL,10,     Fat this years Montpellier
OL,11,     FFestival.
OL,12,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FFrom Edington Priory Church during
OL,14,     Fthe Edington Festival of Music
OL,15,     Fwithin the Liturgy, with music by
OL,16,     FClemens non Papa, Purcell and
OL,17,     FPeeters.
OL,18,G1600 Composer of the Week: Elisabeth
OL,19,G     Jacquet de La Guerre
OL,20,     F3/5. Jacquet de La Guerre plunges
OL,21,     Finto mythical stories to write her
OL,22,     Fvery first opera.
